## SSH Access to cluster nodes

`ssh` access to nodes in this cluster can be provided through an ssh bastion
server. 

The data directory created by this automation (a `data.tgz` artifact in
infra.rox.systems) provides a script to deploy the bastion server in the cluster
(`ssh/deploy/deploy.sh`) and a script to ssh to any node in the cluster once the
bastion in running (`ssh/ssh.sh`).

e.g. Assuming KUBECONFIG is pointing at the cluster created by this automation
and that there is a data directory at ~/infra/"$CLUSTER"/data.

```
## Verify
oc get nodes

## Deploy the bastion
~/infra/"$CLUSTER"/data/ssh/deploy/deploy.sh

## Connect
~/infra/"$CLUSTER"/data/ssh/ssh.sh <any node by name>
```
